flowchart TD
    A[Historical Store Events] --> E[Feature Construction]
    B[Current Store State] --> E
    C[Context Signals] --> E

    E --> D1[Customer Demand / Arrival Forecast]
    E --> D2[Congestion Forecast]
    E --> D3[Product Demand Forecast]

    D1 --> O1[Expected arrivals / activity]
    D2 --> O2[Expected queue / waiting time / congestion risk]
    D3 --> O3[Expected demand by product / stockout risk]

    O1 --> R[Prediction Outputs]
    O2 --> R
    O3 --> R

    R --> X[Decision Engine]

    X --> Y[Recommended actions]

    Y --> Z[Store Action]
    Z --> M[Observed Outcome]

    M --> E

    D1 -.-> B1[Compare against simple baseline]
    D2 -.-> B2[Compare against queueing / simulation baseline]
    D3 -.-> B3[Compare against historical-demand baseline]

    B1 --> V[Model Evaluation]
    B2 --> V
    B3 --> V
